# Generated default-off local authentication policy for the WA-IR standby.
# This scaffold exposes no PostgreSQL TCP listener.  The explicit TCP and
# replication rejects remain defence in depth if a later unsafe listener is
# attempted.  A future reviewed reader path must replace this policy only with
# a separately pinned and independently validated access boundary.

# The PostgreSQL service account may perform local standby maintenance as
# itself through the container-local Unix socket.
local   all             postgres                                peer

# No other local identity, replication connection, or TCP family is admitted.
local   replication     all                                     reject
local   all             all                                     reject
host    replication     all             0.0.0.0/0               reject
host    all             all             0.0.0.0/0               reject
host    replication     all             ::0/0                    reject
host    all             all             ::0/0                    reject
